    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strike Gold and achieve glory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dig deep and unearth your fortune? Gold Mining Simulator 2 takes you on an exhilarating journey from nothing to unimaginable riches in the stunning Alaskan wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/a1e05bfd44d988f2d3a5dbffa9972f44.poster.avif?t=1749808631\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/a1e05bfd44d988f2d3a5dbffa9972f44.webm?t=1749808631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Detailed mining mechanics</strong>: get hands-on with authentic gold mining processes using real-life equipment modelled with precision.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time editable terrain: </strong>shape the land as you work, cutting down trees, digging, and watching the ground shift and settle with realistic physics properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting up and building a camp: g</strong>ather materials to construct your shelter and shape the terrain, readying the perfect base for your gold mining operations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/aa8b7a49ca0fee6e024b24565d59a9ce.poster.avif?t=1749808631\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/aa8b7a49ca0fee6e024b24565d59a9ce.webm?t=1749808631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Multiplayer mode</strong>: join forces or compete with other players in a shared mining environment. Build alliances or engage in friendly rivalry as you strive for the top.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market system</strong>: sell your gold at market highs, manage your finances, and reinvest in better equipment to expand your operation. Your financial decisions will directly impact your team's success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of options</strong>: take on different roles, experimenting with new mining strategies and responsibilities to keep every playthrough exciting and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/7b8948c743352cb8da21bd6cf0acae08.poster.avif?t=1749808631\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/7b8948c743352cb8da21bd6cf0acae08.webm?t=1749808631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain your equipment</strong>: ensure your machinery, from excavators to wash plants, stays in top condition for optimal performance. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore broken parts: i</strong>t\u2019s cheaper to fix than replace. Buy new components and restore parts through an engaging and satisfying process. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your machines</strong>: enhance your machinery and tools for greater efficiency and productivity in gold extraction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/eba6144c33c8260caddca24f88c488dd.poster.avif?t=1749808631\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/eba6144c33c8260caddca24f88c488dd.webm?t=1749808631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Resource management</strong>: carefully manage your resources, such as fuel, parts, and cash, to keep your operation running smoothly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and time cycles</strong>: dynamic weather conditions and realistic day-night cycles impact your mining strategies and efficiency.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transport all your belongings or build a she\ufeffd to store them: m</strong>ove your machinery freely and create shelter to shield your equipment from harsh weather, adapting your strategies to the changing environment.<strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/cf96fca0f13e4c387a8119cde39d85a7.poster.avif?t=1749808631\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885380/extras/cf96fca0f13e4c387a8119cde39d85a7.webm?t=1749808631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive maps with 5 different biomes</strong>: discover vast, open-world environments rich in gold deposits, each location offering unique challenges and opportunities.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side jobs and quests</strong>: when funds run low, boost your income with side quests, ensuring a steady progression towards your gold mining empire.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harsh Alaskan environment:</strong> immerse yourself in Alaska\u2019s rugged wilderness, where untamed nature and wildlife surround you, with town of Falcon Creek offering a rare safe haven </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the golden adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Mining Simulator 2 combines realism, strategy, and adventure in a way that keeps you coming back for more. From managing resources and upgrading equipment to exploring the expansive Alaskan wilderness, every moment offers new challenges and opportunities. Prepare to strike gold, build your fortune, and experience the thrill of gold mining like never before!</p>",
