\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the golden adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Mining Simulator 2 combines realism, strategy, and adventure in a way that keeps you coming back for more. From managing resources and upgrading equipment to exploring the expansive Alaskan wilderness, every moment offers new challenges and opportunities. Prepare to strike gold, build your fortune, and experience the thrill of gold mining like never before!</p>",
    "short_description": "Become a gold miner. Work hard, dig deep, explore the world and become the richest person in Alaska. Use a variety of specialized machines, and before all, cooperate with others in Multiplayer mode!",
